{
  "name": "Telegram AI Chatbot Error Handling",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-5e6f-7a8b-9c0d-e1f2a3b4c5d6e",
      "name": "When Called by Another Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b2c3d4e5-6f7a-8b9c-0d1e-2f3a4b5c6d7e",
              "name": "failedNode",
              "value": "={{ $json.error && $json.error.node ? $json.error.node.name : 'unknown' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3d4e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f-3a4b5c6d7e8f",
              "name": "errorSummary",
              "value": "={{ $json.error && $json.error.message ? $json.error.message : ($json.error && $json.error.description ? $json.error.description : 'Workflow execution failed') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d4e5f6a7-8b9c-0d1e-2f3a-3b4c5d6e7f80",
              "name": "sourceWorkflow",
              "value": "={{ $json.error && $json.error.workflow ? $json.error.workflow.name : 'Telegram AI Chatbot Response' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e5f6a7b8-9c0d-1e2f-3a4b-5c6d7e8f9a0b",
      "name": "Prepare Error Log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $env.TELEGRAM_ADMIN_CHAT_ID }}",
        "text": "=Chatbot error in {{ $json.sourceWorkflow }} (node: {{ $json.failedNode }}): {{ $json.errorSummary }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "f6a7b8c9-0d1e-2f3a-4b5c-6d7e8f9a0b1c",
      "name": "Notify Administrator",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "Telegram API"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a7b8c9d0-1e2f-4a3b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d7e",
      "name": "Notification Delivery Failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        780,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions\n\n- Trigger is **Execute Workflow Trigger** (sub-workflow), matching the main workflow's **Execute Workflow** call with id `tg-ai-chatbot-error`.\n- **Logging** = **Prepare Error Log** Set node fields (`failedNode`, `errorSummary`, `sourceWorkflow`) stored in n8n execution data only; no user message text.\n- Admin alerts go to **$env.TELEGRAM_ADMIN_CHAT_ID** via **Telegram API** credential; 3 send retries.\n- Telegram notify failures end on **Notification Delivery Failed** (no further escalation)."
      },
      "id": "b8c9d0e1-2f3a-4b5c-9d0e-1f2a3b4c5d6e7f",
      "name": "Assumptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -200
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When Called by Another Workflow": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare Error Log",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Prepare Error Log": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Notify Administrator",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Notify Administrator": {
      "main": [
        [],
        [
          {
            "node": "Notification Delivery Failed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
